                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p><strong>Magnetic Insert</strong><br/>Our patented insert slides inside your suit jacket's pocket, holding the Metal Pocket Square™ securely in place without pins or folding.</p><p><strong>Designed to Fit</strong><br/>Compatible with suit jackets, blazers, and tuxedos with a minimum pocket dimensions of 3.5\" wide × 4.5\" deep.</p><p><strong>Magnet Safety</strong><br/>Contains strong magnets. Keep away from pacemakers and other implanted medical devices.</p>",
