                        "text": "<p><strong>Solid Precious Metals</strong><br/>Available in solid sterling silver, gilded bronze, and white bronze. Never plated.</p><p><strong>Handcrafted in New Orleans</strong><br/>Each design begins with an original wax carving by Jose Balli, then is cast using the lost-wax process and finished by hand in our New Orleans studio.</p><p><strong>Product Care</strong><br/>Gently clean with a jewelry polishing cloth. Sterling silver and bronze naturally develop a patina over time.</p>",
