                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p><strong>Complimentary U.S. Shipping</strong><br/>Free ground shipping on all U.S. orders.</p><p><strong>Made to Order</strong><br/>Handcrafted in New Orleans. Please allow approximately 3–4 weeks for production before shipping.</p><p><strong>International Shipping</strong><br/>DHL Express to select countries. Rates calculated at checkout.</p><p><strong>100-Day Returns + Exchanges</strong><br/>Eligible unworn items may be exchanged or returned within 100 days of purchase. Custom, sized, and personalized pieces are final sale.</p><p><strong>Need It By a Certain Date?</strong><br/>Let us know of your event date in the note section at checkout. If you've already placed order, simply email us about the event date so we can help you.</p>",
